{
  "id": "openrouter-cheapest",
  "task": "找到最便宜的可用模型",
  "pageBinding": {
    "urlPattern": "openrouter.ai/models",
    "landmarks": ["Prompt pricing"]
  },
  "steps": [
    { "id": 1, "primary": { "strategy": "text", "value": "Prompt pricing" }, "fallback": { "strategy": "css", "value": "h3" }, "comment": "筛选分区「Prompt pricing」：按每百万 token 的输入价格过滤；选最低区间先筛掉贵的。" },
    { "id": 2, "primary": { "strategy": "text", "value": "Output pricing" }, "fallback": { "strategy": "css", "value": "h3" }, "comment": "筛选分区「Output pricing」：输出 token 通常比输入贵好几倍，便宜模型也要看输出价才算真实成本。" },
    { "id": 3, "primary": { "strategy": "text", "value": "Discounted" }, "fallback": { "strategy": "css", "value": "h3" }, "comment": "筛选分区「Discounted」：只看当前有官方折扣的模型，折扣常在 50% 以上，捡便宜先来这里。" },
    { "id": 4, "primary": { "strategy": "css", "value": "a[href*=\"/models/\"]" }, "fallback": { "strategy": "css", "value": "main li" }, "comment": "模型卡片：对比卡片上的 $/M input 与 $/M output 两个价格，总价 = 输入量×输入价 + 输出量×输出价。" }
  ]
}
